FFS_1_PASSPHRASE "$(FFS_IN_PASSPHRASE_FFS_1)"
GUI OPTIONAL PASSWORD_ENCODED FFS_IN_PASSPHRASE_FFS_1 Password:
DEFAULT_MACRO FFS_IN_CONSTRAINT_GROUP_FFS_1 
